<title>UK: HORSE RACING-TANAASA WITHDRAWN FROM DERBY.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-TANAASA WITHDRAWN FROM DERBY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanaasa was withdrawn on Friday from the Epsom Derby to be run on Saturday after pulling up lame.</p>
<p>Trainer Michael Stoute, whose Entrepreneur is the 4-5 on favourite, said Tanaasa, 66-1, had been lame on his right hind leg on Friday morning.</p>
